<view class="login-page"><view class="login-card"><view class="title">档口商户登录</view><view class="sub">账号由当前农贸市场管理员创建。登录后只能查看本档口订单。</view><input type="number" placeholder="市场 ID" data-field="marketId" bindinput="input"/><input placeholder="商户账号" data-field="account" bindinput="input"/><input password placeholder="登录密码" data-field="password" bindinput="input"/><button loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="login">登录档口工作台</button></view></view>
